"fail if the login manager does not write into <filename>/run/utmp</filename>"
" (note that due to the potential year 2037 problem, Shadow has already "
"stopped writing into it)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
